    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I have a complicated relationship with mathematics. While I recognize its importance, especially in fields like economics that interest me, I find it challenging and often feel overwhelmed by its abstract nature. My parents' differing educational backgrounds—one with a bachelor's degree and the other with no formal education—have also shaped my perspective on math. It’s not something I enjoy, but I respect its necessity.",
